further:
  - slug: babylon
    why: Sumu-la-El, Hammurabi and Samsu-iluna all worked on Sippar's walls from
      Babylon, and the city flourished under Babylonian rule until the Sack of
      Babylon around 1587 BC.
  - slug: borsippa
    why: Borsippa joined the same revolt against Naram-Sin, and Pliny's
